Error [E0063]: `@Caps` is a compiler directive — write it with `#`, not `@`
  --> tests/ui/marker_caps_at.jet:7:5
    |
  7 |     @Caps(Io) {
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: `#` changes what compiles or runs (`#Test`, `#Unsafe`, `#Caps`); `@` is reserved for contracts stated on the declaration below (D-MARKER-FAMILY1).
 Fix: write `#Caps` instead of `@Caps`.
